To assess depth in testing distributed, event-driven APIs with multi-tenancy and reliability requirements.

## Key Concepts
- Idempotency keys and deduplication
- Event-driven consistency between REST and topics
- Per-tenant data isolation on shared bus
- Consumer-driven contract testing
- Resilience tests: broker outages, lag, DLQ routing

